      "content": "Wait, what? Goblins? I'm just trying to make sure this cow doesn't die from sepsis or something. Forget the metaphors, can you just give me a proper clinical list of symptoms for peritonitis or an abscess? I need to know exactly what physical signs indicate a serious internal infection.",
